# Frontend Rules

- Mobile-first: bottom navigation, FAB for add transaction, sheet-based forms.
- Desktop: sidebar layout at `lg:` breakpoint; same components, wider grid.
- Use shadcn/ui + Tailwind CSS for all UI.
- Use TanStack Query for server state; keys scoped by authenticated user.
- Use React Hook Form + Zod resolvers from `@fintrack/shared`.
- Convert tables to card lists on mobile.
- Large touch targets (min 44px) for interactive elements.
- No organization/workspace switcher — single-user context only.
